<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong's Honko says IPO 34.3 time subscribed.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong's Honko says IPO 34.3 time subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transistor maker and distributor Honko International Holdings Ltd said in a statement on Monday its issue of new shares was about 34.3 time subscribed.</p>
<p>It offered a total of 67 million shares last week at HK$1.0 each with warrants in the proportion of one warrant for every five shares subscribed.</p>
<p>Dealings in the shares and warrants are expected to start on the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong on October 14.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
